Found by driving the shipped plans through a real Chromium:

- `section[].field` (Naukri's employment drawer) never resolved, so
  the group could not write anything;
- Playwright resolves locators strictly, so any selector matching two
  nodes — a repeated profile card, a second form — crashed the plan;
- a timed-out wait escaped as Playwright's TimeoutError and discarded
  the run report instead of being recorded as a miss;
- waiting for a `<script type="application/json">` state blob waited
  for it to become *visible*, which it never is;
- redaction rewrote artifact paths, because a run id looks like a
  token, leaving recordings that pointed at nothing.
